[node name="Card" type="Node2D" unique_id=1835792633]

; A shop card's insides (D-81). Positions here are relative to the card's own top-left;
; the screen draws each card at its slot in Build.tscn and adds these. The card's hit rect
; is the manifest's `ui.card.applicant`, 52 x 80. A card is its face, name and price (D-82);
; what it does is read in the inspector once the card is picked. `bg` is the panel art: it
; has a soft margin, so it is sized past the hit rect until its body fills the card, and the
; game draws it there. `stage` is the lighter plate the sprite stands on, filled in the card's
; tone. `price` is the rounded tag along the bottom (`ui.card.price`); `price_text` is the
; figure on it, drawn in the header face at that slot's height, so resizing it resizes the text.
[node name="Layout" type="Node2D" parent="." unique_id=2054466317]

